@fern, for your information at 27:29 in this video you show an image of the Ukrainian Azov Battalion in the context of a neo-Nazi accelerationist group. This is highly misleading.
The Azov unit referenced here was actively fighting the Russian invasion and defending Mariupol in 2022, and it is not a neo-Nazi organization. Claims to the contrary largely stem from Russian state propaganda.
I strongly recommend removing this image and being more precise and factual in future content.
